<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT TO LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>flat or a shade lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Monday. The three-month rate remained at 3.35 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 9 fix	    Sept 6 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.29 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.35 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.50 pct		3.51 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.64 pct		3.64 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.75 pct		3.76 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
